 * SIDE EFFECTS:    
 *
 * STRATEGY:
 *
 * REVISION HISTORY:
 *	Name	Date		Description
 *	----	----		-----------
 *	edwin	8/28/96   	Initial Revision
 *
 ***********************************************************************/
@method HTGenSelectClass, MSG_GEN_RESET
{
  /*
   *  Reset back to its default selections in the list of checkboxes.
   */
